<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-KING'S CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KING'S CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the four-nation King's Cup soccer tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>    Thailand   1   Japan     1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Thailand - Natipong Sritong-in 70</p>
<p>Japan - Shoji Jo 65</p>
<p>    Sweden     2   Romania   0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sweden - Andreas Andersson 7, Jozo Matovac 85.</p>
<p>Next matches: February 11 - Thailand v Sweden (0900 GMT kickoff), Romania v Japan (1200 GMT).</p>
</text>
